direction: down
vars: {d2-config: {layout-engine: elk}}
classes: {
  q: {shape: diamond; style: {fill: "#fff59d"; stroke: "#f57f17"; font-color: "#0a0f25"}}
  start: {style: {fill: "#e1bee7"; stroke: "#6a1b9a"; font-color: "#0a0f25"; bold: true}}
  a: {style: {fill: "#c8e6c9"; stroke: "#2e7d32"; font-color: "#0a0f25"; font: mono}}
  b: {style: {fill: "#bbdefb"; stroke: "#0d47a1"; font-color: "#0a0f25"; font: mono}}
  c: {style: {fill: "#ffe0b2"; stroke: "#e65100"; font-color: "#0a0f25"; font: mono}}
}
title: |md
  # "Which docs can Anne see?": pick the approach, then the API
  limits are each project's own docs; "none" = no such call in the project's .proto / routes
| {near: top-center}

start: "list page:\nfilter + sort + paginate\nover docs Anne can see" {class: start}
q1: "accessible set small?\nSpiceDB: trouble past 10k\nOpenFGA: 3s / 1000 default" {class: q}
q2: "does Anne see a\nlarge share of the\ncandidate rows?\n(no = the Google\nDrive case)" {class: q}

A: |md
  **A. lookup, then WHERE id IN (...)**

  - SpiceDB: LookupResources (streamed, cursor)
  - OpenFGA: ListObjects / StreamedListObjects
  - Permify: LookupEntity / LookupEntityStream
  - Topaz: GetGraph with object_id omitted
  - Warrant: /v2/query "select ... where ..."
  - Keto: none (Expand returns a tree)
| {class: a}

B: |md
  **B. DB page, bulk check, repeat**

  - SpiceDB: CheckBulkPermissions, one ZedToken per page
  - OpenFGA: BatchCheck
  - Permify: BulkCheck
  - Keto: BatchCheck
  - Topaz: Checks
| {class: b}

C: |md
  **C. your own index, fed by a change stream**

  - SpiceDB: Watch, resumable from a ZedToken; or AuthZed Materialize (Dedicated only)
  - OpenFGA: ReadChanges, polled with a continuation token
  - Permify: Watch (stream)
  - Keto, Topaz, Warrant: no stream, so dual-write
| {class: c}

start -> q1
q1 -> A: yes
q1 -> q2: no
q2 -> B: yes
q2 -> C: no
